WEBVTT

00:12:56.720 --> 00:13:00.176
If I have any hope
of making the world better,

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:05.216
I have to love and leverage
both of these ways that I'm understood,

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:08.320
and therein lies the value and the hue.

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.336
Thank you.

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:14.200
(Applause and cheers)